<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20913] Recursive option for lfs pool pin/unpin commands</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20913</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently &lt;tt&gt;lfs pool pin/unpin&lt;/tt&gt; on a directory only sets the &lt;tt&gt;lustre.pin&lt;/tt&gt; xattr on that directory itself, so new files created under it inherit the pin, but existing files and subdirectories are untouched. &lt;tt&gt;-&lt;del&gt;recursive&lt;/tt&gt; walks the target directory tree and applies the same pin/unpin (and &lt;tt&gt;&lt;/del&gt;&lt;del&gt;only&lt;/tt&gt;/&lt;tt&gt;&lt;/del&gt;-not-pool&lt;/tt&gt;, where given) to every file and subdirectory found, so an existing tree can be pinned in one shot instead of applying the xattr to each file by hand.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment />
